{"title":"잔향산가","artist":"Aimer","sourceId":"reference:ykDU8E3MLOSVxcdIpO2S","sourceHash":"b0e64cc11b7e8007b20b67672b52335973ca8fe267a8506b5aa8a4cba03320c2","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":9.85,"end":12.66,"text":"（ダーダラ ダラダダ）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":12.66,"end":15.4,"text":"（ダラダダ ダラダダ）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":15.4,"end":18.37,"text":"（ダーダラ ダラダダ）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":18.37,"end":21.33,"text":"（ダラダダ ダラ ダダ〜ラ）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":21.33,"end":24.1,"text":"誰が袖に咲く幻花","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":24.1,"end":26.97,"text":"ただ そこに藍を落とした","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":26.97,"end":29.97,"text":"派手に色を溶かす夜に 銀朱の月を添えて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":32.35,"end":35.35,"text":"転がるように風を切って 躓くごとに強くなった","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":37.82,"end":40.82,"text":"光も痛みも怒りも全部 抱きしめて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":42.7,"end":45.7,"text":"選ばれなければ 選べばいい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":48.45,"end":51.45,"text":"声よ 轟け 夜のその向こうへ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":51.71,"end":54.71,"text":"涙で滲んでた あんなに遠くの景色まで響き渡れ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":59.67,"end":62.67,"text":"何を奏でて？ 誰に届けたくて？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":63.01,"end":66.00999999999999,"text":"不確かなままでいい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":66.07,"end":68.78,"text":"どんなに暗い感情も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":68.78,"end":71.6,"text":"どんなに長い葛藤も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":71.6,"end":74.6,"text":"歌と散れ 残響","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":74.67,"end":77.2,"text":"（ダーダラ ダラダダ）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":77.2,"end":80.03,"text":"（ダラダダ ダラダダ）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":80.03,"end":82.71000000000001,"text":"（ダーダラ ダラダダ）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":82.71000000000001,"end":85.71000000000001,"text":"（ダラダダ ダラ ダダ〜ラ）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":85.81,"end":88.78,"text":"ただ一人舞う千夜","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":88.78,"end":91.5,"text":"違えない帯を結べば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":91.5,"end":94.5,"text":"派手な色も負かす様に 真紅の香こそあはれ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":96.85,"end":99.55,"text":"この先どんなつらい時も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":99.55,"end":102.35,"text":"口先よりも胸を張って","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":102.35,"end":105.35,"text":"描いた夢の灯りを全部 辿るだけ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":107.35,"end":110.35,"text":"逃げ出すため ここまで来たんじゃないだろ？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":129.78,"end":132.78,"text":"選ばれなければ 選べばいい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":142.32,"end":145.32,"text":"声をからして 燃える花のように","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":145.72,"end":148.72,"text":"闇間を照らしたら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":148.82999999999998,"end":151.82999999999998,"text":"曖昧過ぎる正解も譜面にして","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":153.78,"end":156.78,"text":"夜を数えて朝を描く様な","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":157.13,"end":160.1,"text":"鮮やかな音を鳴らす","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":160.1,"end":162.82,"text":"どんなに深い後悔も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":162.82,"end":165.63,"text":"どんなに高い限界も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":165.63,"end":168.48,"text":"掻き消して 残響","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":168.48,"end":171.17000000000002,"text":"（ダーダラ ダラダダ）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":171.17000000000002,"end":174.05,"text":"（ダラダダ ダラダダ）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":174.05,"end":176.89,"text":"（ダーダラ ダラダダ）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":176.89,"end":179.89,"text":"（ダラダダ ダラ ダダ〜ラ）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}